ResolvedAgent.description:
Resolved-agent summary echoed on ``ready`` when the session referenced a
registry agent (``agent.name``). Informational only — never authoritative;
clients don't act on it.

SemanticEagerness.description:
How eagerly OpenAI's ``semantic_vad`` closes the user's turn.

``low`` waits longer for the user to continue, ``high`` responds sooner;
``auto`` is the provider default and behaves like ``medium``.
